+    regardless of confidence."* The two novelty readers below did not enforce
+    it -- both tested the model-asserted float directly -- so a finding whose
+    falsifier the HARNESS re-ran and did not demonstrate still counted as a
+    critical discovery, held the zero-critical streak open, and shaped
+    `gamma_critical`. Measured over the archive (producer:
